{"type":"message","id":"61a345d4","parentId":"0eb879c3","timestamp":"2026-03-25T14:43:12.263Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Recommended questions**\n**(4/4)** Have you noticed any **fever, chills, unintentional weight loss, reduced appetite, or a recent drop in urine amount**? Also, when was your **last kidney scan or oncology/urology follow-up**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02b664bbec88280c0169c3f47ecbf8819185b9f8f3bb0dfd35\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":270,"output":64,"cacheRead":33536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33870,"cost":{"input":0.000675,"output":0.00096,"cacheRead":0.008383999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010019}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774449789731}}
